#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:2
msgid "3. Typed Control Builders, Bitmasks, & Layouts"
msgstr "3. 强类型构建器、属性位掩码与布局"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:4
msgid ""
"``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` is generated directly from ``xent-"
"kit/tools/catalog.lua`` and provides typed creation structs, property "
"setters, and event subscription helpers for all 70+ controls."
msgstr ""
"``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 直接由 ``xent-kit/tools/catalog.lua`` 生成，"
"为全部 70 余种控件提供强类型创建结构体、单属性设置函数与事件订阅包装函数。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:9
msgid "Naming Conventions in ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>``"
msgstr "``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 命名规律"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:11
msgid ""
"Every catalog control ``<ctrl>`` (such as ``container``, ``card``, "
"``scroll``, ``text``, ``button``, ``checkbox``, ``slider``, ``textbox``, "
"``combo``, ``list``, ``nav``, ``dialog``, ``commandbar``) follows the "
"same generated pattern:"
msgstr ""
"目录中的每种控件 ``<ctrl>`` （如 ``container`` 、 ``card`` 、 ``scroll`` 、 ``text`` 、 ``button`` 、 "
"``checkbox`` 、 ``slider`` 、 ``textbox`` 、 ``combo`` 、 ``list`` 、 ``nav`` 、 ``dialog`` 、 ``commandbar`` ）"
"均遵循统一的生成命名规则："

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Properties struct**: ``Xtk<Ctrl>Props`` (for example "
"``XtkButtonProps``, ``XtkContainerProps``, ``XtkTextBoxProps``)."
msgstr "**属性结构体** ： ``Xtk<Ctrl>Props`` （例如 ``XtkButtonProps`` 、 ``XtkContainerProps`` 、 ``XtkTextBoxProps`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Bitmask constants**: ``XTK_<CTRL>_<PROP>_MASK`` (for example "
"``XTK_BUTTON_TEXT_MASK``, ``XTK_BUTTON_STYLE_MASK``, "
"``XTK_BUTTON_W_MASK``)."
msgstr "**属性掩码常量** ： ``XTK_<CTRL>_<PROP>_MASK`` （例如 ``XTK_BUTTON_TEXT_MASK`` 、 ``XTK_BUTTON_STYLE_MASK`` 、 ``XTK_BUTTON_W_MASK`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Transaction creator**: ``XtkLocalId xtk_<ctrl>_create(XtkTxn *txn, "
"XtkNodeRef parent, Xtk<Ctrl>Props const *props);``"
msgstr "**事务内创建函数** ： ``XtkLocalId xtk_<ctrl>_create(XtkTxn *txn, XtkNodeRef parent, Xtk<Ctrl>Props const *props);``"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Live property setters**: ``bool xtk_<ctrl>_set<prop>(XtkScene *scene, "
"XtkCtrl control, <type> value, XtkChangeStamp change);``"
msgstr "**运行期属性设置函数** ： ``bool xtk_<ctrl>_set<prop>(XtkScene *scene, XtkCtrl control, <type> value, XtkChangeStamp change);``"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Event subscribers**: ``XtkSubRef xtk_<ctrl>_on<event>(XtkTxn *txn, "
"XtkNodeRef target, XtkEventFn fn, void *arg);``"
msgstr "**事件订阅函数** ： ``XtkSubRef xtk_<ctrl>_on<event>(XtkTxn *txn, XtkNodeRef target, XtkEventFn fn, void *arg);``"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:27
msgid ""
"Shared layout fields—``w``, ``h``, ``grow``, ``shrink``, ``self`` "
"(``XentFlexAlign``), ``ml``, ``mt``, ``mr``, ``mb`` (margins), and "
"``tip`` (tooltip string)—appear directly on every control's "
"``Xtk<Ctrl>Props`` struct."
msgstr ""
"公共布局字段—— ``w`` 、 ``h`` 、 ``grow`` 、 ``shrink`` 、 ``self`` （ ``XentFlexAlign`` ）、 "
"``ml`` / ``mt`` / ``mr`` / ``mb`` （外边距）以及 ``tip`` （工具提示文本）——直接内嵌在每种控件的 ``Xtk<Ctrl>Props`` 结构体中。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:32
msgid "Working with ``.set`` Masks and Strings"
msgstr "使用 ``.set`` 位掩码与字符串切片"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:34
msgid ""
"In C compound literals, omitted struct fields default to ``0``—which is "
"also a meaningful value for ``gap = 0.0f``, ``sel = 0``, or enum variant "
"``0``. The ``.set`` bitmask tells the encoder exactly which fields you "
"populated:"
msgstr ""
"在 C 复合字面量中，未填写的字段默认初始化为 ``0`` ——而 ``0`` 同时也是 ``gap = 0.0f`` 、 ``sel = 0`` 或首个枚举值的有效取值。"
"因此通过 ``.set`` 位掩码明确告知编码器本次要设置哪些字段："

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:51
msgid "String Length Rules"
msgstr "字符串长度规则"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:53
msgid ""
"Every string property on ``Xtk<Ctrl>Props`` has both a pointer field "
"(such as ``.text``, ``.icon``, ``.placeholder``, ``.tip``) and a byte-"
"length field (``.text_len``, ``.icon_len``, ``.placeholder_len``, "
"``.tip_len``), and string setters take ``(char const *data, uint32_t "
"len)``:"
msgstr ""
"``Xtk<Ctrl>Props`` 中的每个字符串属性都成对提供指针字段（如 ``.text`` 、 ``.icon`` 、 ``.placeholder`` 、 ``.tip`` ）"
"与字节长度字段（ ``.text_len`` 、 ``.icon_len`` 、 ``.placeholder_len`` 、 ``.tip_len`` ），"
"字符串 setter 函数同样接收 ``(char const *data, uint32_t len)`` ："

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Null-terminated C strings**: Leaving ``.text_len = 0`` (or passing "
"``len = 0`` to ``xtk_<ctrl>_set<prop>``) automatically measures "
"``strlen(data)`` when ``data`` is non-NULL."
msgstr "**以 NUL 结尾的普通 C 字符串** ：保持 ``.text_len = 0`` （或在 ``xtk_<ctrl>_set<prop>`` 中传 ``len = 0`` ）时，非空 ``data`` 会自动调用 ``strlen(data)`` 计算长度。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Explicit byte slices & compile-time literals**: Passing a non-zero "
"length skips ``strlen`` and supports non-null-terminated UTF-8 slices—for"
" example ``#define LIT(s) .text = s, .text_len = sizeof(s) - 1`` for "
"string literals or ``(uint32_t) snprintf(...)`` for formatted buffers."
msgstr ""
"**显式字节切片与编译期字面量** ：传入非零长度可直接跳过 ``strlen`` 并支持无结尾符的 UTF-8 切片——例如对字面量定义 "
"``#define LIT(s) .text = s, .text_len = sizeof(s) - 1`` ，或传入 ``(uint32_t) snprintf(...)`` 的返回值。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:65
msgid ""
"The batch copies string bytes immediately during ``xtk_*_create`` and "
"``xtk_*_set*``, so temporary stack buffers like ``char buf[64]`` are safe"
" to reuse right after the call returns."
msgstr "批次在调用 ``xtk_*_create`` 与 ``xtk_*_set*`` 时会立即拷贝字符串内容，因此局部栈数组 ``char buf[64]`` 在调用返回后即可安全复用。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:70
msgid "Writing Reusable Flex Layout Helpers"
msgstr "封装可复用的 Flex 布局辅助函数"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:72
msgid ""
"Imperative code becomes as compact to read as declarative code once you "
"wrap your common column, row, card, and label patterns into small helper "
"functions (the exact technique used in "
"``fluxent/examples/gallery_imp/helpers.c``):"
msgstr ""
"将常用的纵列、横排、卡片与标签封装成几行辅助函数后，命令式布局代码同样紧凑易读"
"（ ``fluxent/examples/gallery_imp/helpers.c`` 即采用此方式）："

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:120
msgid "Key ``XtkContainerProps`` layout flags:"
msgstr "``XtkContainerProps`` 核心布局字段："

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:122
msgid "``.dir``: ``XTK_STACK_COLUMN`` or ``XTK_STACK_ROW``."
msgstr "``.dir`` ： ``XTK_STACK_COLUMN`` （纵向）或 ``XTK_STACK_ROW`` （横向）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:123
msgid ""
"``.items`` and ``.justify``: Cross-axis ``XentFlexAlign`` and main-axis "
"``XentFlexJustify``."
msgstr "``.items`` 与 ``.justify`` ：交叉轴 ``XentFlexAlign`` 对齐与主轴 ``XentFlexJustify`` 分布。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:125
msgid ""
"``.pl``, ``.pt``, ``.pr``, ``.pb``: Inner padding on left, top, right, "
"bottom."
msgstr "``.pl`` 、 ``.pt`` 、 ``.pr`` 、 ``.pb`` ：左、上、右、下四边内边距。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:126
msgid "``.fill``: Stretches the container along its parent's main/cross space."
msgstr "``.fill`` ：使容器拉伸填满父容器可用空间。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:127
msgid ""
"``.fith`` / ``.fitw``: Sizes the container tightly to its children's "
"measured height or width inside scrollable regions."
msgstr "``.fith`` / ``.fitw`` ：在滚动区域内使容器高度或宽度紧贴子元素测量尺寸。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:131
msgid "Generic Property Access & Composite Setters"
msgstr "通用属性读写与复合数据源函数"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:133
msgid ""
"Alongside the generated per-control wrappers, ``<xtk/xtk_scene.h>`` "
"provides control-agnostic helpers:"
msgstr "除按控件生成的包装函数外， ``<xtk/xtk_scene.h>`` 还提供与具体控件类型无关的通用操作："

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:136
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Setting properties inside a multi-op transaction**: Call "
"``xtk_txn_set(&txn, ref, XTK_PROP_WIDTH, (XtkValue) {.kind = "
"XTK_VALUE_F32, .u.f32 = 240.0f}, (XtkChangeStamp) {0})`` to batch "
"multiple property updates across many controls into a single commit."
msgstr ""
"**在多操作事务内批量修改属性** ：调用 ``xtk_txn_set(&txn, ref, XTK_PROP_WIDTH, (XtkValue) {.kind = XTK_VALUE_F32, .u.f32 = 240.0f}, (XtkChangeStamp) {0})`` "
"可将跨多个控件的属性修改合并进同一次原子提交。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:139
msgid ""
"**Reading current property values**: Call ``xtk_ctrl_get(&scene, ctrl, "
"XTK_PROP_TEXT, &view, &stamp)``. String and byte slices inside "
"``XtkValueView`` point at the host's internal storage and stay valid "
"until that property is modified again or the host is destroyed."
msgstr ""
"**读取当前属性值** ：调用 ``xtk_ctrl_get(&scene, ctrl, XTK_PROP_TEXT, &view, &stamp)`` 。"
" ``XtkValueView`` 内的字符串与字节切片直接指向宿主内部存储，有效至该属性下次变更或宿主销毁为止。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:143
msgid ""
"**Populating composite item collections**: Controls that own structured "
"child definitions have dedicated transaction helpers in "
"``<xtk/xtk_scene.h>``:"
msgstr "**填充复合子项集合** ：拥有结构化子项定义的控件在 ``<xtk/xtk_scene.h>`` 中配有专用事务设置函数："

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:146
msgid ""
"``xtk_txn_setitems(&txn, target, strings, count)`` (and live "
"``xtk_ctrl_setitems``) — Populates ``ComboBox``, ``AutoSuggestBox``, "
"``BreadcrumbBar``, or ``LoopingSelector`` item lists."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_txn_setitems(&txn, target, strings, count)`` （及运行期 ``xtk_ctrl_setitems`` ）——填充 "
"``ComboBox`` 、 ``AutoSuggestBox`` 、 ``BreadcrumbBar`` 或 ``LoopingSelector`` 的字符串列表。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:149
msgid ""
"``xtk_txn_setselitems(&txn, target, selector_items, count)`` — Populates "
"``SelectorBar`` items with icons and labels."
msgstr "``xtk_txn_setselitems(&txn, target, selector_items, count)`` —— 填充带图标与文字的 ``SelectorBar`` 选项。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:151
msgid ""
"``xtk_txn_settabs(&txn, target, tab_descs, count)`` — Populates "
"``TabView`` tab headers."
msgstr "``xtk_txn_settabs(&txn, target, tab_descs, count)`` —— 填充 ``TabView`` 标签栏。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:153
msgid ""
"``xtk_txn_settree(&txn, target, &tree_desc)`` — Populates a ``TreeView`` "
"hierarchy."
msgstr "``xtk_txn_settree(&txn, target, &tree_desc)`` —— 填充 ``TreeView`` 层级树节点。"

#: ../../source/imperative/properties.rst:155
msgid ""
"``xtk_txn_setnav(&txn, target, &nav_desc)`` — Populates "
"``NavigationView`` menu items, headers, separators, footer items, and "
"integrated window title bar settings."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_txn_setnav(&txn, target, &nav_desc)`` —— 填充 ``NavigationView`` 的导航项、"
"分类头、分隔线、底部固定项以及一体化窗口标题栏配置。"
